[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11761.349, "timestamp": "03:16:01", "text": "钥匙？钥匙应该会显示在那边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.269, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "我看到了控制类型的鼠标瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.15, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "简化现实，不，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11774.71, "timestamp": "03:16:14", "text": "出问题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.389, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "你切换了控制模式，对吧？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11789.99, "timestamp": "03:16:29", "text": "哦，等等。放错东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11793.03, "timestamp": "03:16:33", "text": "什么？我碰巧看错了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11798.71, "timestamp": "03:16:38", "text": "是的。所以你从街机厅去了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11802.87, "timestamp": "03:16:42", "text": "操控飞机变得逼真"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11806.63, "timestamp": "03:16:46", "text": "控制你的飞机然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11810.309, "timestamp": "03:16:50", "text": "模拟器控制你的飞机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11813.11, "timestamp": "03:16:53", "text": "啊，所以这和……完全不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11816.07, "timestamp": "03:16:56", "text": "你要找的开关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11817.51, "timestamp": "03:16:57", "text": "一秒钟。我会查找这个名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11819.03, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "text": "再次。那玩意儿到底叫什么名字？"}]